Template: homelab-sso/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Used only once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role.

Template: homelab-sso/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:
 Used only once, at first install. Also written into config.yml's
 database.host, so the running service connects through the pooler.

Template: homelab-sso/homelab_api_base_url
Type: string
Default: http://127.0.0.1:3000
Description: Base URL where homelab-api is reachable:
 Written into config.yml's homelab_api.base_url -- every login,
 introspect, refresh, and revoke this app does proxies through here.

Template: homelab-sso/listen_port
Type: string
Default: 2502
Description: Port for homelab-sso to listen on:

Template: homelab-sso/drive_redirect_uri
Type: string
Default: https://drive.test.mailmasker.org/oauth/callback
Description: homelab-drive's OAuth callback URL:
 Registered as this deployment's "drive" OAuth client redirect_uri --
 must match exactly what homelab-drive itself is configured to use.

Template: homelab-sso/drive_client_secret
Type: password
Description: Shared secret for the "drive" OAuth client (blank = generate one):
 Leave blank on a first install to auto-generate a random secret (it
 will be printed at the end of this install for you to copy into
 homelab-drive's own config). Set it explicitly on a reinstall/rotation
 to match a secret homelab-drive is already configured with.

Template: homelab-sso/roundcube_redirect_uri
Type: string
Default: https://mail.test.mailmasker.org/index.php?_task=login&_action=oauth
Description: homelab-roundcube's OAuth callback URL:
 Registered as this deployment's "roundcube" OAuth client redirect_uri
 -- must match exactly what homelab-roundcube itself is configured to
 send (query-string form, NOT Roundcube's PATH_INFO-style default of
 "index.php/login/oauth" -- see homelab-roundcube's
 script/homelab-roundcube-patch-oauth-sso for why).

Template: homelab-sso/roundcube_client_secret
Type: password
Description: Shared secret for the "roundcube" OAuth client (blank = generate one):
 Leave blank on a first install to auto-generate a random secret (it
 will be printed at the end of this install for you to copy into
 homelab-roundcube's own config). Set it explicitly on a reinstall/
 rotation to match a secret homelab-roundcube is already configured
 with.
